# Club & Grub - World 9, stage 1: "Cloudbreak Climb" (designer D9a, Book II "The Far Shore").
# The climb up the side of the Sky Spire (difficulty 8, Expert only; DESIGN.md A.2 / A.3 / A.6): from the cloud sea
# at the foot of the spire to its first summit, 140 rows up. Steam geysers, drop clouds, vines through holes in the
# cloud-rock shelves, one-way cloud ledges; eagles (harriers) and storm pterodactyl darts ride the updrafts, storm
# pterodactyls patrol the open sky. The spear lies at checkpoint 1 beside a slate pillar with two bark boards on its
# face: two spear steps up to the Cave Painting (index 12) in a nook under the cliff. Higher up: shelf S of
# checkpoint 2 under the high cloud T (a vine through T, a see-saw in co-op), the cloud shelf of checkpoint 3 with a
# slate block over its end and a vine shaft beside it (a pulley in co-op), the ledges to checkpoint 4, drop clouds
# along the cliff, the vine to checkpoint 5 and a last geyser and stair to the exit totem (on to Thunderhead Glide).

